msgstr "<span id=\"qasm2-import\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Import an OpenQASM 2 program into Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"
msgstr ""
"Importar un programa OpenQASM 2 en Qiskit {#import-an-openqasm-2-program-"
"into-qiskit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Two functions import OpenQASM 2 programs into Qiskit.\n"
"These are [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), which takes a filename, and [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), which takes the OpenQASM 2 program as a string.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hay dos funciones para importar programas OpenQASM 2 en Qiskit.\n"
"Estas son [`qasm2.load()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#load), que recibe un nombre de archivo, y [`qasm2.loads()`](../api/qiskit/qasm2#loads), que recibe el programa OpenQASM 2 como cadena de texto.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [OpenQASM 2 Qiskit "
"API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) for more information.\n"
msgstr ""
"Consulta la [API de OpenQASM 2 de "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qasm2) para obtener más "
"información.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import simple programs {#import-simple-programs}"
msgstr "Importar programas simples {#import-simple-programs}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For most OpenQASM 2 programs, you can simply use `qasm2.load` and "
"`qasm2.loads` with a single argument.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para la mayoría de los programas OpenQASM 2, puedes usar `qasm2.load` y "
"`qasm2.loads` con un solo argumento.\n"

